---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Azathoth"
  description="Azathoth is an open-source framework for constructing, evaluating, and optimizing AI systems."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="site-container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Azathoth</p>

      <h1>
        Build AI systems
        that can measure
        and improve themselves.
      </h1>

      <p class="lede">
        Azathoth is an open-source framework for constructing,
        evaluating, and optimizing multi-model AI systems across
        quality, reliability, latency, cost, and capability.
      </p>

      <div class="actions">
        <a
          class="button button-primary"
          href="https://github.com/EldritchInc/azathoth"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          View on GitHub
          <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="problem">
    <div class="site-container split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Why Azathoth exists</p>
        <h2>
          AI software has become
          too complex to tune by hand.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="copy">
        <p>
          Modern AI systems are assembled from models, prompts, tools,
          context, retrieval, memory, evaluators, and multi-step workflows.
        </p>

        <p>
          Every choice creates another dimension in the search space.
          Which model should run this step? Which prompt performs best?
          Which configuration meets the quality requirement without
          wasting latency or money?
        </p>

        <p class="emphasis">
          Azathoth treats those questions as engineering problems that
          can be measured experimentally instead of answered by intuition.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="system">
    <div class="site-container">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">The system</p>

      <h2>
        Construct.
        Evaluate.
        Optimize.
      </h2>

      <div class="system-grid">
        <article>
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Construct</h3>
          <p>
            Define explicit workflows made from models, prompts, tools,
            context, and execution steps.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Execute</h3>
          <p>
            Run workflows through provider-neutral abstractions with
            step-scoped model and tool bindings.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Evaluate</h3>
          <p>
            Measure outcomes against explicit goals and collect repeatable
            evidence about quality, reliability, latency, and cost.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>04</span>
          <h3>Optimize</h3>
          <p>
            Compare candidates and search for configurations that produce
            better system-level tradeoffs.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="principles">
    <div class="site-container split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Architecture</p>

        <h2>
          Built for systems,
          not isolated prompts.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="principle-list">
        <article>
          <h3>Provider-neutral</h3>
          <p>
            Models are capabilities, not architecture. Azathoth separates
            workflow behavior from individual model providers.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Goal-directed</h3>
          <p>
            Evaluation begins with explicit goals so optimization has a
            definition of better.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Workflow-native</h3>
          <p>
            AI applications are multi-step software systems. Azathoth
            represents and evaluates them that way.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Evidence-driven</h3>
          <p>
            Decisions are based on measured runs, experiments, and
            scorecards rather than assumptions about which model or prompt
            should perform best.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="metrics">
    <div class="site-container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Optimization dimensions</p>

      <div class="metric-grid">
        <div>
          <strong>Quality</strong>
          <span>Does the system produce the right result?</span>
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>Reliability</strong>
          <span>Does it keep producing acceptable results?</span>
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>Latency</strong>
          <span>How quickly can the workflow complete?</span>
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>Cost</strong>
          <span>What does the system consume to produce the result?</span>
        </div>

        <div>
          <strong>Capability</strong>
          <span>What can the system successfully accomplish?</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="open-source">
    <div class="site-container open-source-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Open source</p>

        <h2>
          Built in public.
          Designed to evolve.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="open-source-copy">
        <p>
          Azathoth is being developed as open-source infrastructure for
          engineers building complex AI systems.
        </p>

        <p>
          The project is designed around explicit architecture, strict
          typing, repeatable evaluation, and a test-driven development
          process.
        </p>

        <div class="actions">
          <a
            class="button button-light"
            href="https://github.com/EldritchInc/azathoth"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            Explore the repository
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="install">
    <div class="site-container install-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Get started</p>

        <h2>
          Azathoth is coming
          to Python.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="command" aria-label="Azathoth installation command">
          <code>pip install azathoth</code>
        </div>

        <p class="install-note">
          The initial open-source release is coming soon.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding-block: clamp(6rem, 13vw, 12rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .eyebrow-light {
    color: #9dbbac;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7.5rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    line-height: 0.93;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    min-height: 3.25rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-foreground);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      background-color 150ms ease,
      color 150ms ease,
      border-color 150ms ease;
  }

  .button-primary {
    background: var(--color-foreground);
    color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .button-primary:hover,
  .button-primary:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .button-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  .button-secondary:hover,
  .button-secondary:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-foreground);
    color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .problem,
  .principles,
  .metrics,
  .install {
    padding-block: clamp(6rem, 12vw, 11rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .split,
  .install-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 9rem);
  }

  .split h2,
  .install h2,
  .open-source h2 {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .copy {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .copy p,
  .open-source-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .copy .emphasis {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .system {
    padding-block: clamp(7rem, 14vw, 13rem);
    background: var(--color-foreground);
    color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .system h2 {
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 8rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    line-height: 0.9;
  }

  .system-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    margin-top: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
    border-top: 1px solid #303530;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #303530;
  }

  .system-grid article {
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .system-grid article:first-child {
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .system-grid article + article {
    border-left: 1px solid #303530;
  }

  .system-grid span {
    color: #8b928d;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .system-grid h3 {
    margin: 3rem 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .system-grid p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #b8bdb9;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .principle-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .principle-list article {
    padding-block: 2.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .principle-list h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .principle-list p {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .metric-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
    margin-top: 4rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .metric-grid div {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 220px;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .metric-grid div:first-child {
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .metric-grid div + div {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .metric-grid strong {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .metric-grid span {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .open-source {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .open-source-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 0.8fr);
    gap: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 10rem);
    padding-block: clamp(7rem, 14vw, 13rem);
  }

  .open-source-copy p {
    color: #d0ded6;
  }

  .button-light {
    border-color: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .button-light:hover,
  .button-light:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .install {
    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .command {
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    background: var(--color-foreground);
    color: var(--color-surface);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  code {
    font-family:
      "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.15rem);
  }

  .install-note {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .system-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .system-grid article:nth-child(3) {
      padding-left: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #303530;
      border-left: 0;
    }

    .system-grid article:nth-child(4) {
      border-top: 1px solid #303530;
    }

    .metric-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .metric-grid div {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }

    .metric-grid div + div {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      border-left: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .split,
    .install-inner,
    .open-source-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(3.25rem, 16vw, 5rem);
    }

    .actions {
      align-items: stretch;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .button {
      justify-content: space-between;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .system-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .system-grid article {
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }

    .system-grid article + article {
      border-top: 1px solid #303530;
      border-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>